Template: glibc/upgrade
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Restart NSS-dependent services before upgrading libc?
 Running services and programs that use NSS may need to be restarted during
 a libc upgrade so name lookups and authentication continue to work.

Template: glibc/restart-services
Type: string
Description: Services to restart for the libc upgrade:
 Review the space-separated list of init scripts that should be restarted as
 part of this upgrade.

Template: glibc/restart-failed
Type: error
Description: Some services could not be restarted after the libc upgrade
 One or more services failed to restart automatically. Start them manually
 after the package upgrade completes.

Template: glibc/disable-screensaver
Type: error
Description: Restart xscreensaver or xlockmore before upgrading libc
 Running sessions of xscreensaver or xlockmore may need to be restarted to
 keep desktop authentication usable after the upgrade.

Template: libraries/restart-without-asking
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Restart affected services automatically during library upgrades?
 If enabled, service restarts required by library upgrades will proceed
 without asking for confirmation.

Template: glibc/kernel-too-old
Type: error
Description: Kernel must be upgraded before installing this libc build
 This libc build requires kernel version ${kernel_ver} or later.

Template: glibc/kernel-not-supported
Type: note
Description: Kernel version is older than the supported libc baseline
 This libc build expects kernel version ${kernel_ver} or later. Older
 kernels may still work but are not part of the supported configuration.
